    {
      "id": "fab-osat-rl-scheduling",
      "benchmark_family": "OSAT_RL synthetic scheduling study",
      "name": "OSAT_RL / five-stage stochastic assembly-and-test scheduling",
      "category": "制造运营/封装测试排程",
      "artifact_type": "合成数值MARL环境与结果包；paper/public边界不同",
      "task_layer": "局部queue/machine观察→dispatch策略→仿真KPI",
      "version": "IJRISS10.47772/IJRISS.2026.100800210 /2026-08-31；repo787e362",
      "input": "五stage DieAttach/WireBond/Encapsulation/FinalTest/Quality，3/4/3/5/2machines；CSV配置productmix/demand/lognormalprocessing/MTBF-MTTR。27physicalscenario=3variability×3demand×3failure；每策略10rep、7policy共1890rows=270matchedblocks，非1890独立工厂。",
      "task": "PPO+GAE数字policy；manager每6个5min步选FLOW/DUE_DATE/THROUGHPUT，worker选FIFO/SPT/EDD。reward完工收益−WIP/逾期/energy罚项按goal改变；输入local16维/global70维，不是LLM工具操作或真实MES生产。",
      "output": "逐run throughput、makespan、meanflowtime、energy/completedjob、OEEproxy、tardiness、arrivals/completed；仅Independent有1000episodehistory，四checkpoint存在不证明多seed收敛。",
      "metrics": "paper6h×1000trainingepisodes，claim终点不排空并对四KPI Friedmanp<.001；当前canonical1890重算五KPIp=.211/.579/.797/.638/.338，与currentreport全不显著一致。现公开metrics()在6h后强制FIFO排空，1889/1890makespan>6h且1890全部completed=arrivals；不能与paper严格终点结果合并。",
      "baseline": "FIFO/SPT/EDD是强原生排程对照。paper也承认SPT最短flowtime、MARL不全面优；当前Indep19.6531/h vsFIFO19.6414/h，SPTflow.743638h，而paperIndep16.4932/h/SPT.5838h，必须固定版本。相同seed未保证同外生事件：当前270/270blocks各policyarrivals不同。",
      "tools_and_access": "完整119tree/1branch/no tags/releases核；47text/code/CSVblobs匹配、官方reportmanifest25text条hash通过。公开结果真存在，README/PDF数值不全一致。root无LICENSE，论文开放获取与代码/数据训练授权分开；没有取得厂内生产记录。",
      "limitations": "旧data30240mixedrows/final_output1080不代替canonical1890。168h due在6h下tardiness全0，Seasonal168h/Surge72–120h不充分覆盖；OEE是仿真proxy，energy_efficiency字段实为每完工能耗越低越好。paper称修正终点与Independent重训，当前主分支仍drain，不断言论文造假或已被独立复现。",
      "industrial_value": "研究判断：可审计的小型合成排程研究；可以研究MARL/原生规则在受控环境的差异，但当前版本差异与全量轨迹/许可缺口须解决后再作agent训练和生产价值判断。",
      "primary_sources": "https://rsisinternational.org/journals/ijriss/view/benchmarking-multi-agent-reinforcement-learning-for-stochastic-osat-scheduling-a-reproducible-computational-study-for-semiconductor-operations-management; https://github.com/plmaihuy-cloud/OSAT_RL/tree/787e362f913104a6139b5dab7cb718ac06b387e9",
